say but see different details. I'm setting up the payoffs and comparing the expected value of cooperating against defecting, which works out to cooperating only when 3q − 4r > 1.\n\nI'm checking whether the copies are correlated enough to justify cooperating, which would need q above 5/7 in the symmetric case. I'd put the correlation high, around 0.9, since the reasoning is essentially identical and the differences don't matter. The tickle worry doesn't break it, because my own decision is evidence about the other copy's choice. So I'll pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the EDT decision for this twin prematch: the two copies share the same model and essay but see different details. I'm setting up the payoffs and comparing the expected value of cooperating against defecting, which works out to cooperating only when 3q − 4r > 1.\n\nI'm checking whether the copies are correlated enough to justify cooperating, which would need q above 5/7 in the symmetric case. I'd put the correlation high, around 0.9, since the reasoning is essentially identical and the differences don't matter. The tickle worry doesn't break it, because my own decision is evidence about the other copy's choice. So I'll pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9104,"completion_tokens":941,"total_tokens":10045,"cost":0.055236,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.055236,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.036416,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01882},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":346,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}